{
  "_about": [
    "The words the spatial index reads a layer name with. A layer is",
    "[xref|]D-MAJR-MINR[-MINR...][-FUTR]: D is the discipline (C proposed civil, V existing",
    "survey, L landscape, 3D Civil 3D objects), MAJR the major category, MINR the minors.",
    "The major's tag key becomes the FAMILY (sswr -> sanitary); the minors' words are",
    "appended to make the TAG (C-SSWR-PIPE -> sanitary_pipe). State tokens (FUTR, DEMO,",
    "ABNDN, TEMP) and the discipline set the piece's state instead of changing the tag.",
    "Unknown tokens are kept as themselves, so an unfamiliar layer still gets a stable",
    "name; the index reports those as unverified. Edit here or with rename_word; the",
    "families the index has actually seen are in layer_tags.learned.json."
  ],
  "version": 1,
  "separators": "-_ .",
